  "about": "Turns a supervisor's own wording in its public register into scope term keys (dimension:key), per authority key. PUBLIC_REGISTERS.md section 4.1, D-121. 'categories' maps a business name exactly as the register writes it, main or other business; the terms are what the licence allows, not what the company chooses to do: a Swedish credit institution (a bank or a credit market company) may provide payment services and means of payment and safekeep securities (lag (2004:297) om bank- och finansieringsrörelse 7 kap. 1 § 4, 5 and 9), so it is never excluded from payments, card issuing and acquiring or custody; an empty list marks a name as known and mapped to nothing. 'licences' maps a phrase found in a licence's text, compared case-insensitively; a licence matching no phrase is shown and not mapped. Every key must already be a term of the live taxonomy; one that is not is dropped. Wording read from Finansinspektionen's CSV export on 2026-10-05 (Verification_Log.md).",
